<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>⚠️ Demo SQL Injection</title>
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
</head>
<body class="bg-red-50 min-h-screen">
  <div class="bg-red-600 text-white text-center text-sm font-semibold py-2 px-4">
    ⚠️ HALAMAN INI SENGAJA NUNJUKIN QUERY RENTAN, buat demo materi. JANGAN dipake di production.
  </div>
  <%- include('../partials/demo-nav', { title: '4. SQL Injection' }) %>

  <main class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
    <div class="bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 text-blue-800 text-sm rounded-lg px-4 py-3 mb-6">
      Coba ketik <code>' OR '1'='1</code> di kotak bawah. Di kolom AMAN,
      itu diperlakukan sebagai teks pencarian biasa (gak ketemu produk apapun).
      Di kolom RENTAN, itu ngerusak struktur query SQL-nya dan malah
      nampilin SEMUA produk (bypass filter pencarian).
    </div>

    <form method="GET" action="/demo/sql-injection" class="flex gap-2 mb-6">
      <input
        type="text"
        name="q"
        value="<%= query %>"
        placeholder="' OR '1'='1"
        class="flex-1 border border-red-300 rounded-lg px-3 py-2 text-sm"
      />
      <button class="bg-red-600 hover:bg-red-700 text-white px-4 py-2 rounded-lg text-sm font-semibold">Cari</button>
    </form>

    <% if (searched) { %>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
        <div class="bg-white border border-green-300 rounded-xl p-4">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-600 mb-2">✅ AMAN — parameterized query (Sequelize <code>Op.iLike</code>)</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-2"><%= safeResults.length %> produk ketemu</p>
          <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
            <% safeResults.forEach(function(p) { %>
              <li class="border-b border-gray-100 pb-1"><%= p.name %></li>
            <% }) %>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white border border-red-300 rounded-xl p-4">
          <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-red-600 mb-2">⚠️ RENTAN — string SQL disambung manual</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-2 font-mono break-all bg-gray-50 rounded p-1">
            <%= unsafeQueryString %>
          </p>
          <% if (unsafeError) { %>
            <p class="text-xs text-yellow-700 bg-yellow-50 rounded p-2 mb-2">SQL Error: <%= unsafeError %></p>
          <% } %>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mb-2"><%= unsafeResults.length %> produk ketemu</p>
          <ul class="text-sm space-y-1">
            <% unsafeResults.forEach(function(p) { %>
              <li class="border-b border-gray-100 pb-1"><%= p.name %></li>
            <% }) %>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    <% } %>

    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 mt-6">
      Kode lengkap: <code>controllers/demo.unsafe.controller.js</code> (<code>sqlInjectionDemo</code>).
      Bandingin sama <code>controllers/search.controller.js</code> yang emang beneran dipake di endpoint <code>/search</code>.
    </p>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
